ons in conducting research by the Project Investigator.\\",\\n        \\"templateIntent\\": \\"evaluation\\",\\n        \\"templateIntentAlternates\\": [],\\n        \\"templateIntentConfidence\\": 1.0,\\n        \\"supportLevel\\": \\"full\\",\\n        \\"confidence\\": 0.95,\\n        \\"sourceAnchors\\": [\\n          {\\n            \\"asset_id\\": \\"cmojqces2000cc2ddpi08szdm\\",\\n            \\"page\\": 8,\\n            \\"section\\": null,\\n            \\"urlFragment\\": null,\\n            \\"quote\\": \\"* Preference will be given to the proposals having field based experience and innovations in conducting research by the Project Investigator.\\",\\n            \\"note\\": null,\\n            \\"confidence\\": 1.0\\n          }\\n        ]\\n      },\\n      {\\n        \\"key\\": \\"alignment_with_priority_approaches\\",\\n        \\"label\\": \\"Alignment with Priority Research Approaches\\",\\n        \\"type\\": \\"rubric\\",\\n        \\"workflowMode\\": \\"app_support\\",\\n        \\"required\\": false,\\n        \\"repeatable\\": false,\\n        \\"visibleWhen\\": null,\\n        \\"wordLimit\\": 0,\\n        \\"charLimit\\": 0,\\n        \\"options\\": [],\\n        \\"schema\\": {},\\n        \\"guidance\\": \\"ERIC shall give priority to the following research approaches: Policy research in education; Qualitative and participatory approaches involving triangulation of methodologies; Case studies and mixed method researches; Inter-disciplinary, collaborative, multi-centric, and pan-Indian researches; Collaborative action research projects involving several organisations/ agencies; Innovations related to qualitative improvement of content and process of school education.\\",\\n        \\"templateIntent\\": \\"alignment\\",\\n        \\"templateIntentAlternates\\": [\\n          \\"evaluation\\"\\n        ],\\n        \\"templateIntentConfidence\\": 0.9,\\n        \\"supportLevel\\": \\"full\\",\\n        \\"confidence\\": 0.95,\\n        \\"sou