nancial support to faculty members working in Universities/ colleges/ research organisations/NCERT for conducting research related to school education and teacher education.", "heading": "Division of Educational Research", "segmentId": "seg_001", "sourceType": "segment"}, {"quote": "To scrutinize and recommend grants to proposals related to research and innovation projects received from the constituent units of the NCERT as well as from outside agencies and individuals", "heading": "ROLES AND FUNCTIONS OF ERIC", "segmentId": "seg_001", "sourceType": "segment"}, {"quote": "ERIC recognizes development and testing of alternate methods, curricular inputs, classroom practices, management practices to improve quality and quantity of educational outcomes by individual/or a team of professionals as studies of innovation.", "heading": "GUIDELINES FOR SUBMISSION OF PROPOSAL", "segmentId": "seg_001", "sourceType": "segment"}], "disciplines": [{"quote": "conducting research related to school education and teacher education.", "heading": "Division of Educational Research", "segmentId": "seg_001", "sourceType": "segment"}, {"quote": "Policy research in education", "heading": "Approaches of Research", "segmentId": "seg_001", "sourceType": "segment"}, {"quote": "Priority Areas of research", "heading": "Division of Educational Research", "segmentId": "seg_001", "sourceType": "segment"}], "contact_info": [], "scheme_title": [{"quote": "Educational Research and Innovations Committee (ERIC) Guidelines for submission of research proposal", "heading": "Division of Educational Research", "segmentId": "seg_001", "sourceType": "segment"}], "sponsor_type": [], "career_stages": [{"quote": "faculty members", "heading": "Division of Educational Research", "segmentId": "seg_001", "sourceType": "segment"}, {"quote": "scholars working within the NCERT departments and its constituents", "heading": "GUIDELINES FOR SUBMISSION OF PROPOSAL", "segmentId": "seg_001", "sourceType": "segment"}], "funding_k