nal textile brands."], "sectionKeys": ["self-sustainability_revenue_generation_plan"], "captureBasis": ["user_confirmed"], "thrustLinkage": ["Livelihoods", "Socio-economic development"], "sourceTemplatePointer": "questions.self-sustainability_revenue_generation_plan"}, {"label": "Possibility of replication of project in similar areas", "status": "needs_review", "keywords": ["MSME cooperative model", "PAR methodology", "Scalable blueprint", "State backing", "Regional textile clusters"], "pointKey": "questions_possibility_of_replication", "stageKey": "sustainability_and_scale", "ruleNotes": ["Provides a concrete adoption pathway and identifies state networks as the condition for scale."], "confidence": 0.95, "factBullets": ["Replication strategy relies on packaging the MSME cooperative model and PAR methodology into a scalable blueprint.", "The blueprint will be expanded to other regional textile clusters utilizing state backing."], "sectionKeys": ["possibility_of_replication"], "captureBasis": ["user_confirmed"], "thrustLinkage": ["capacity enhancement", "socio-economic development"], "sourceTemplatePointer": "questions.possibility_of_replication"}], "stageMapping": {"outcomes": {"stageKey": "outcomes", "stageTitle": "Outcomes", "discussionPoints": [{"key": "near_term_outcomes", "label": "Near-term outcomes", "origin": "default", "helpText": "Immediate changes expected during the project.", "priority": "P1", "conversationRole": "user_required", "sourceTemplatePointer": null}, {"key": "long_term_outcomes", "label": "Longer-term effect", "origin": "default", "helpText": "What this enables after project completion.", "priority": "P2", "conversationRole": "user_required", "sourceTemplatePointer": null}, {"key": "questions_proposed_subject_area", "label": "Proposed Subject Area", "origin": "template", "helpText": "Required facts: Directly answer \\"Proposed Subject Area\\".", "priority": "P2", "conversationRole": "context_only", "sourceTemplatePointer": "questions.propose