lation charges, transport, taxes/duties/levies, etc. and try to avail tax/duty exemptions as applicable to your institution/ organization. Proper record should be maintained for the items procured under this Head. As per rule 149 of GFR, the procurement of Goods & Services is Mandatory for Goods and/or Services available on GeM Portal only and PI will also follow DoE's guidelines for incurring expenditure under the different sub-head. The budget under construction cost is only for low-cost structures like Common Facility Centre (CFC) and/or renovation or refurbishing of existing space and not for construction of new buildings or structures. Approval of such grant is at sole discretion of DST and as per extant GFR norms. Budgetary quotations (min. 3 no.) will be required in support of estimates for equipment, if project is approved for financial support.", "required": true, "mustAvoid": [], "mustCover": ["Equipment cost", "Fabrication/ installation cost", "Construction cost", "Project Staff", "Consumables", "Contingency", "Travel", "Others", "Institutional Overheads"], "sectionKey": "budget", "wordBudget": null, "sectionType": "budget_rows", "citationMode": "no_citations", "dependencies": [], "workflowMode": "app_support", "characterLimit": null, "reviewerIntent": "Please give estimates, if the equipment is to be fabricated locally for prototype testing etc. Include installation charges, transport, taxes/duties/levies, etc. and try to avail tax/duty exemptions as applicable to your institution/ organization. Proper record should be maintained for the items procured under this Head. As per rule 149 of GFR, the procurement of Goods & Services is Mandatory for Goods and/or Services available on GeM Portal only and PI will also follow DoE's guidelines for incurring expenditure under the different sub-head. The budget under construction cost is only for low-cost structures like Common Facility Centre (CFC) and/or renovation or refurbishing of existing space and not for construction of new buildings or structures. Approval of such grant is at sole discretion of DST and as per extant GFR norms. Budgetary quotations (min. 3 no.) will be required in support of estimates for equipment, if project is approved for financial support.", "templateIntent": "budget", "grantTemplateGuidance": {"pointer": "budget", "guidanceText": ["Please give estimates, if the equipment is to be fabricated locally for prototype testing etc. Include installation charges, transport, taxes/duties/levies, etc. and try to avail tax/duty exemptions as applicable to your institution/ organization. Proper record should be maintained for the items procured under this Head. As per rule 149 of GFR, the procurement of Goods & Services is Mandatory for Goods and/or Services available on GeM Portal only and PI will also follow DoE's guidelines for incurring expenditure under the different sub-head. The budget under construction cost is only for low-cost structures like Common Facility Centre (CFC) and/or renovation or refurbishing of existing space and not for construction of new buildings or structures. Approval of such grant is at sole discretion of DST and as per extant GFR norms. Budgetary quotations (min. 3 no.) will be required in support of estimates for equipment, if project is approved for financial support."], "reviewerGoal": "Please give estimates, if the equipment is to be fabricated locally for prototype testing etc. Include installation charges, transport, taxes/duties/levies, etc. and try to avail tax/duty exemptions as applicable to your institution/ organization. Proper record should be maintained for the items procured under this Head. As per rule 149 of GFR, the procurement of Goods & Services is Mandatory for Goods and/or Services available on GeM Portal only and PI will also follow DoE's guidelines for incurring expenditure under the different sub-head. The budget under construction cost is only for low-cost structures like Common Facility Centre (CFC) a