ecord should be maintained for the items procured under this Head. As per rule 149 of GFR, the procurement of Goods & Services is Mandatory for Goods and/or Services available on GeM Portal only and PI will also follow DoE's guidelines for incurring expenditure under the different sub-head. The budget under construction cost is only for low-cost structures like Common Facility Centre (CFC) and/or renovation or refurbishing of existing space and not for construction of new buildings or structures. Approval of such grant is at sole discretion of DST and as per extant GFR norms. Budgetary quotations (min. 3 no.) will be required in support of estimates for equipment, if project is approved for financial support.", "priority": "P1", "conversationRole": "can_infer_and_confirm", "sourceTemplatePointer": "budget.budget_overview"}, {"key": "budget_budget_equipment_cost", "label": "Equipment cost", "origin": "template", "helpText": "Mapped from the approved template", "priority": "P1", "conversationRole": "can_infer_and_confirm", "sourceTemplatePointer": "budget.budget_equipment_cost"}, {"key": "budget_budget_fabrication_installation_cost", "label": "Fabrication/ installation cost", "origin": "template", "helpText": "Bill of materials/estimate for fabrication & development cost should be provided", "priority": "P1", "conversationRole": "can_infer_and_confirm", "sourceTemplatePointer": "budget.budget_fabrication_installation_cost"}, {"key": "budget_budget_construction_cost", "label": "Construction cost", "origin": "template", "helpText": "Bill of materials/ estimate for construction cost should be provided. The budget under construction cost is only for low-cost structures like Common Facility Centre (CFC) and/or renovation or refurbishing of existing space and not for construction of new buildings or structures.", "priority": "P1", "conversationRole": "can_infer_and_confirm", "sourceTemplatePointer": "budget.budget_construction_cost"}, {"key": "budget_budget_project_staff", 