er proposed project. | Required facts: Provide: Gender-wise distribution - type and total size of target population (Male/ Female/ Transgender)", "priority": "P2", "conversationRole": "context_only", "sourceTemplatePointer": "questions.target_beneficiaries"}, {"key": "questions_background_of_target_community", "label": "Background of target community", "origin": "template", "helpText": "considering Indigenous Knowledge (IK)/ Traditional Knowledge (TK), skill & practices, socio-economic status and demographic details of target population including their present livelihood conditions, present average income level and occupations of the target beneficiaries. | Reviewer goal: considering Indigenous Knowledge (IK)/ Traditional Knowledge (TK), skill & practices, socio-economic status and demographic details of target population including their present livelihood conditions, present average income level and occupations of the target beneficiaries. | Required facts: Directly answer \\"Background of target community\\".", "priority": "P2", "conversationRole": "context_only", "sourceTemplatePointer": "questions.background_of_target_community"}, {"key": "questions_target_population_problem_socioeconomic_status", "label": "State the target population related problem you seek to address and brief of their Socio-Economic status", "origin": "template", "helpText": "should be based on identification of weakest links/gaps/problems in the predominant livelihood, health, quality of life and socio-economic status of people in select area the problem identification should be supported with evidence based data may be based on livelihood system analysis, investigators fieldwork in the target area, district (industrial) reports, data from various others reports, NRLM, SRLM data etc | Reviewer goal: should be based on identification of weakest links/gaps/problems in the predominant livelihood, health, quality of life and socio-economic status of people in select area the problem identificat