n", "IP protection", "Monetization pathways", "Youth out - migration"], "ruleNotes": ["Successfully identifies structural failure rather than just symptom, aligning closely with reviewer expectations for S&T rationale."], "updatedAt": "2026-04-24T11:37:38.273Z", "confidence": 0.95, "factBullets": ["Current documentation efforts are historically extractive.", "Existing platforms catalog knowledge without offering community IP protection or monetization pathways.", "Status quo solutions fail to address the underlying economic drivers of youth out-migration."], "captureBasis": ["user_confirmed"], "thrustLinkage": ["Justifies the creation of a community-owned data governance trust for sustainable IP management."], "ruleCompliance": {"reason": null, "status": "ok", "rescopeNeeded": false}, "sourceTemplatePointer": null}, "priority": "P2", "sourceTemplatePointer": null}, {"key": "sections_part_3_problem_identification_and_proposed_st_interventions", "label": "PART 3: PROBLEM IDENTIFICATION AND PROPOSED S&T INTERVENTIONS", "status": "covered", "capture": {"keywords": ["LLM - driven IKS repository", "Drought - resistant farming", "Climate shocks", "SFURTI organic farming ecosystem"], "ruleNotes": ["This perfectly addresses the call requirement for Part 3 by clearly stating both the problem and the S&T component in one reviewer-ready narrative."], "updatedAt": "2026-04-24T11:36:00.191Z", "confidence": 0.95, "factBullets": ["Summarized Part 3 by stating the project addresses the rapid loss of traditional drought-resistant farming knowledge due to climate shocks.", "Proposed S&T intervention is establishing an LLM-driven IKS repository that scientifically validates and integrates knowledge into the local SFURTI organic farming ecosystem."], "captureBasis": ["user_confirmed"], "thrustLinkage": ["Aligns the core problem of knowledge loss directly with the S&T intervention and the local MSME/SFURTI infrastructure."], "ruleCompliance": {"reason": null, "status": "ok", "rescopeNeeded": false}, "sourceTemplatePointer": "sections.part_3_problem_identification_and_proposed_st_interventions"}, "priority": "P2", "sourceTemplatePointer": "sections.part_3_problem_identification_and_proposed_st_interventions"}, {"key": "questions_background_of_target_community", "label": "Background of target community", "status": "covered", "capture": {"keywords": ["Indigenous multi - cropping matrices", "Native millets", "Localized legumes", "Heritage seed preservation", "Erratic monsoon cycles"], "ruleNotes": ["Directly answers the 'Background of target community' requirement regarding Indigenous Knowledge (IK) / Traditional Knowledge (TK)."], "updatedAt": "2026-04-24T11:38:24.449Z", "confidence": 0.95, "factBullets": ["Target community relies on indigenous multi-cropping matrices, such as intercropping native millets with localized legumes.", "The community utilizes heritage seed preservation techniques specifically adapted to erratic monsoon cycles."], "captureBasis": ["user_confirmed"], "thrustLinkage": ["Establishes the specific Indigenous Knowledge (IK) that the S&T intervention (LLM repository) will validate and protect."], "ruleCompliance": {"reason": null, "status": "ok", "rescopeNeeded": false}, "sourceTemplatePointer": "questions.background_of_target_community"}, "priority": "P2", "sourceTemplatePointer": "questions.background_of_target_community"}, {"key": "questions_target_population_problem_socioeconomic_status", "label": "State the target population related problem you seek to address and brief of their Socio-Economic status", "status": "covered", "capture": {"keywords": ["Agricultural debt", "Chemical inputs", "NRLM data", "Input costs", "Income below ₹60,000"], "ruleNotes": ["Successfully addresses the guideline requiring weakest link identification supported by NRLM/district evidence."], "updatedAt": "2026-04-24T11:41:04.582Z", "confidence": 0.95, "factBullets": ["The weakest link for the target community is rising agricultural debt driven by surging input costs.", "Debt is exacerbated by elders abandoning heritage seeds for expensive chemical inputs.", "Project will use NRLM data to demonstrate how input costs keep net incomes below ₹60,000."], "captureBasis": ["user_confirmed"], "thrustLinkage": ["Provides concrete socio-economic evidence justifying the urgency of reversing knowledge loss."], "ruleCompliance": {"reason": null, "status": "ok", "rescopeNeeded": false}, "sourceTemplatePointer": "questions.target_population_problem_socioeconomic_status"}, "priority": "P2", "sourceTemplatePointer": "questions.target_population_problem_socioeconomic_status"}, {"key": "questions_brief_industrial_scenario", "label": "Brief Industrial Scenario of the target area", "status": "covered", "capture": {"keywords": ["District Industrial Profile", "Cash - crop agro - processing", "Millet and legume value addition", "SFURTI - linked youth"], "ruleNotes": ["Perfectly satisfies the requirement to reference the industrial profile and connect it to MSME schemes (SFURTI)."], "updatedAt": "2026-04-24T11:46:23.792Z", "confidence": 0.95, "factBullets": ["The current District Industrial Profile heavily prioritizes standard cash-crop agro-processing.", "The profile completely overlooks climate-resilient millet and legume value addition.", "SFURTI-linked youth trained by the project will pioneer this overlooked value-addition sector."], "captureBasis": ["user_confirmed"], "thrustLinkage": ["Identifies a clear gap in the current industrial focus that the proposed SFURTI youth clusters will address."], "ruleCompliance": {"reason": null, "status": "ok", "rescopeNeeded": false}, "sourceTemplatePointer": "questions.brief_industrial_scenario"}, "priority": "P2", "sourceTemplatePointer": "questions.brief_industrial_scenario"}, {"key": "questions_existing_solutions_for_problem", "label": "Existing regional/ National/ International solutions for the proposed problem", "status": "covered", "capture": {"keywords": ["Digital agriculture", "Docume