.885Z", "confidence": 0.95, "factBullets": ["Core problem is the loss of traditional drought-resistant farming knowledge due to youth out-migration.", "Loss of knowledge is exacerbating the impact of climate shocks, leading to failing crop yields and plunging incomes."], "captureBasis": ["user_confirmed"], "thrustLinkage": ["LLM-based capture and validation of Indigenous Knowledge Systems (IKS)"], "ruleCompliance": {"reason": "Core problem is identified but lacks regional specificity and quantifiable scale.", "status": "ok", "rescopeNeeded": false}, "sourceTemplatePointer": null}, "priority": "P1", "sourceTemplatePointer": null}, {"key": "problem_scale", "label": "Scale and urgency", "status": "covered", "capture": {"keywords": ["elder generation passing", "urgent digitization", "failing yields"], "ruleNotes": ["Urgency signal is reviewer-ready. Scale (number of elders/farmers) still needs quantification."], "updatedAt": "2026-04-24T11:31:16.885Z", "confidence": 0.9, "factBullets": ["Action is critically urgent because the elder generation holding the knowledge is passing away.", "Delays will result in irreversible loss of drought-resistant practices."], "captureBasis": ["user_confirmed"], "thrustLinkage": ["Timely deployment of LLM capture tools before generation passes"], "ruleCompliance": {"reason": null, "status": "ok", "rescopeNeeded": false}, "sourceTemplatePointer": null}, "priority": "P1", "sourceTemplatePointer": null}, {"key": "evidence_gap", "label": "Evidence or practice gap", "status": "covered", "capture": {"keywords": ["chemical farming", "institutional mechanisms", "scientific validation", "knowledge redistribution"], "ruleNotes": ["Clear and specific practice gap that directly supports the need for an S&T intervention."], "updatedAt": "2026-04-24T11:32:31.361Z", "confidence": 0.95, "factBullets": ["Existing state agricultural extension services focus entirely on modern chemical farming.", "There is a lack of institutional mechanisms to scientifically validate traditional drought-resistant methods and redistribute them to the youth."], "captureBasis": ["user_confirmed"], "thrustLinkage": ["Identifies the core system failure driving the loss of IKS in farming."], "ruleCompliance": {"reason": null, "status": "ok", "rescopeNeeded": false}, "sourceTemplatePointer": null}, "priority": "P2", "sourceTemplatePointer": null}, {"key": "sections_part_3_problem_identification_and_proposed_st_interventions", "label": "PART 3: PROBLEM IDENTIFICATION AND PROPOSED S&T INTERVENTIONS", "status": "pending", "capture": null, "priority": "P2", "sourceTemplatePointer": "sections.part_3_problem_identification_and_proposed_st_interventions"}, {"key": "questions_background_of_target_community", "label": "Background of target community", "status": "covered", "capture": {"keywords": ["subsistence farming", "rainfed farming", "income below ₹60,000"], "ruleNotes": ["Fulfills the requirement for present average income level and occupations."], "updatedAt": "2026-04-24T11:33:20.717Z", "confidence": 0.95, "factBullets": ["Target community's primary occupation is subsistence rainfed farming.", "Average annual household income is currently below ₹60,000."], "captureBasis": ["user_confirmed"], "thrustLinkage": ["Establishes precise socioeconomic baseline for the target demographic required by the call"], "ruleCompliance": {"reason": "Punjab does not officially have notified Scheduled Tribes; demographic definition needs careful alignment with official state/district records.", "status": "ok", "rescopeNeeded": false}, "sourceTemplatePointer": "questions.background_of_target_community"}, "priority": "P2", "sourceTemplatePointer": "questions.background_of_target_community"}, {"key": "questions_target_population_problem_socioeconomic_status", "label": "State the target population related problem you seek to address and brief of their Socio-Economic status", "status": "covered", "capture": {"keywords": ["district agricultural reports", "NRLM data", "