n of new buildings or structures. Approval of such grant is at sole discretion of DST and as per extant GFR norms. Budgetary quotations (min. 3 no.) will be required in support of estimates for equipment, if project is approved for financial support.", "priority": "P1", "conversationRole": "can_infer_and_confirm", "sourceTemplatePointer": "budget.budget_overview"}, {"key": "budget_budget_equipment_cost", "label": "Equipment cost", "origin": "template", "helpText": "Mapped from the approved template", "priority": "P1", "conversationRole": "can_infer_and_confirm", "sourceTemplatePointer": "budget.budget_equipment_cost"}, {"key": "budget_budget_fabrication_installation_cost", "label": "Fabrication/ installation cost", "origin": "template", "helpText": "Bill of materials/estimate for fabrication & development cost should be provided", "priority": "P1", "conversationRole": "can_infer_and_confirm", "sourceTemplatePointer": "budget.budget_fabrication_installation_cost"}, {"key": "budget_budget_construction_cost", "label": "Construction cost", "origin": "template", "helpText": "Bill of materials/ estimate for construction cost should be provided. The budget under construction cost is only for low-cost structures like Common Facility Centre (CFC) and/or renovation or refurbishing of existing space and not for construction of new buildings or structures.", "priority": "P1", "conversationRole": "can_infer_and_confirm", "sourceTemplatePointer": "budget.budget_construction_cost"}, {"key": "budget_budget_project_staff", "label": "Project Staff", "origin": "template", "helpText": "team of scientists/engineers/technical support staff including social scientist, refer latest OM of SEED-DST", "priority": "P1", "conversationRole": "can_infer_and_confirm", "sourceTemplatePointer": "budget.budget_project_staff"}, {"key": "budget_budget_consumables", "label": "Consumables", "origin": "template", "helpText": "Supplies/Materials for adaptive R&D/technology refinement, Fabrication, Installa