-5 concise, measurable objectives aligned with the project title and scope."], "confidence": 0.98, "factBullets": ["Objective 1: Design and validate semi-mechanized winders and temperature-controlled dye baths.", "Objective 2: Establish a centralized STI Hub serving 2,000 artisans.", "Objective 3: Provide training to artisans on eco-friendly processing techniques.", "Objective 4: Increase the average monthly income of the target group by 50%."], "sectionKeys": ["proposed_objectives"], "captureBasis": ["user_confirmed"], "thrustLinkage": ["Clearly outlines actionable, measurable S&T interventions that directly tackle the stated root cause."], "sourceTemplatePointer": "questions.proposed_objectives"}, {"label": "Continuation after funding", "status": "needs_review", "keywords": ["MSME cooperative", "Post - grant", "Scale", "Phulkari preservation model"], "pointKey": "continuity", "stageKey": "sustainability_and_scale", "ruleNotes": ["Provides a highly credible structural pathway for post-project self-sustainability, a major DST reviewer priority."], "confidence": 0.95, "factBullets": ["Post-grant continuity will be ensured by registering the centralized Hub as an independent MSME cooperative.", "The cooperative model provides a formal legal structure to scale the Phulkari preservation model regionally after DST funding ends."], "sectionKeys": [], "captureBasis": ["user_confirmed"], "thrustLinkage": ["livelihoods", "sustainable development"], "sourceTemplatePointer": null}, {"label": "Self-sustainability/revenue generation plan of the project work", "status": "needs_review", "keywords": ["Cooperative model", "Master trainers", "Usage fee", "Buy - back agreements"], "pointKey": "questions_self_sustainability_revenue_generation_plan", "stageKey": "sustainability_and_scale", "ruleNotes": ["Satisfies the reviewer requirement for clear techno-economic viability and self-sustainability post-DST support."], "confidence": 0.95, "factBullets": ["The Hub will sustain itself via 