al for irrigation; as well as climate, land use patterns, crops and cropping systems, natural resources and raw materials, availability of special skills or trades, and the presence of local organizations such as Panchayats, cooperatives or voluntary groups. | Required facts: Directly answer \\"Proposed Geographical coverage Area\\".", "priority": "P2", "conversationRole": "can_infer_and_confirm", "sourceTemplatePointer": "questions.proposed_geographical_coverage_area"}, {"key": "questions_lab_field_testing_locations", "label": "Institution/ places where detailed lab/ field testing or experimentations and validation will be carried out", "origin": "template", "helpText": "Required facts: Directly answer \\"Institution/ places where detailed lab/ field testing or experimentations and validation will be carried out\\".", "priority": "P2", "conversationRole": "can_infer_and_confirm", "sourceTemplatePointer": "questions.lab_field_testing_locations"}, {"key": "questions_technical_backup_support_and_linkages", "label": "Technical back-up support and linkages established in the project area", "origin": "template", "helpText": "State Govt. involvement for large scale technology dissemination; forward & backward linkages; stakeholders with emphasis on extent and nature of their involvement in documenting traditional knowledge, development of technology / modification/ transfer/ adoption etc. | Reviewer goal: State Govt. involvement for large scale technology dissemination; forward & backward linkages; stakeholders with emphasis on extent and nature of their involvement in documenting traditional knowledge, development of technology / modification/ transfer/ adoption etc. | Required facts: State Govt. involvement for large scale technology dissemination", "priority": "P2", "conversationRole": "can_infer_and_confirm", "sourceTemplatePointer": "questions.technical_backup_support_and_linkages"}, {"key": "questions_methodology", "label": "Methodology", "origin": "template", "help