ent sub-head. The budget under construction cost is only for low-cost structures like Common Facility Centre (CFC) and/or renovation or refurbishing of existing space and not for construction of new buildings or structures. Approval of such grant is at sole discretion of DST and as per extant GFR norms. Budgetary quotations (min. 3 no.) will be required in support of estimates for equipment, if project is approved for financial support.", "priority": "P1", "conversationRole": "can_infer_and_confirm", "sourceTemplatePointer": "budget.budget_overview"}, {"key": "budget_budget_equipment_cost", "label": "Equipment cost", "origin": "template", "helpText": "Mapped from the approved template", "priority": "P1", "conversationRole": "can_infer_and_confirm", "sourceTemplatePointer": "budget.budget_equipment_cost"}, {"key": "budget_budget_fabrication_installation_cost", "label": "Fabrication/ installation cost", "origin": "template", "helpText": "Bill of materials/estimate for fabrication & development cost should be provided", "priority": "P1", "conversationRole": "can_infer_and_confirm", "sourceTemplatePointer": "budget.budget_fabrication_installation_cost"}, {"key": "budget_budget_construction_cost", "label": "Construction cost", "origin": "template", "helpText": "Bill of materials/ estimate for construction cost should be provided. The budget under construction cost is only for low-cost structures like Common Facility Centre (CFC) and/or renovation or refurbishing of existing space and not for construction of new buildings or structures.", "priority": "P1", "conversationRole": "can_infer_and_confirm", "sourceTemplatePointer": "budget.budget_construction_cost"}, {"key": "budget_budget_project_staff", "label": "Project Staff", "origin": "template", "helpText": "team of scientists/engineers/technical support staff including social scientist, refer latest OM of SEED-DST", "priority": "P1", "conversationRole": "can_infer_and_confirm", "sourceTemplatePointer": "budget.budget_project_staff"}, {"key": "budget_budget_consumables", "label": "Consumables", "origin": "template", "helpText": "Supplies/Materials for adaptive R&D/technology refinement, Fabrication, Installation and field testing/training etc.", "priority": "P1", "conversationRole": "can_infer_and_confirm", "sourceTemplatePointer": "budget.budget_consumables"}, {"key": "budget_budget_contingency", "label": "Contingency", "origin": "template", "helpText": "Mapped from the approved template", "priority": "P1", "conversationRole": "can_infer_and_confirm", "sourceTemplatePointer": "budget.budget_contingency"}, {"key": "budget_budget_travel", "label": "Travel", "origin": "template", "helpText": "International travel is not permitted. Includes Local travel & logistics, Outstation travel & logistics, and DST's Field visits/annual review meetings etc.", "priority": "P1", "conversationRole": "can_infer_and_confirm", "sourceTemplatePointer": "budget.budget_travel"}, {"key": "budget_budget_others", "label": "Others", "origin": "template", "helpText": "Outsourcing, Field Testing/ Demonstration, Technology Dissemination, Documentation, Publicity, Training & capacity building, Publication and patenting etc.", "priority": "P1", "conversationRole": "can_infer_and_confirm", "sourceTemplatePointer": "budget.budget_others"}, {"key": "budget_budget_institutional_overheads", "label": "Institutional Overheads", "origin": "template", "helpText": "Mapped from the approved template", "priority": "P1", "conversationRole": "can_infer_and_confirm", "sourceTemplatePointer": "budget.budget_institutional_overheads"}], "templatePointers": ["submissionRules.international_travel_rule", "budget.budget_overview", "budget.budget_equipment_cost", "budget.budget_fabrication_installation_cost", "budget.budget_construction_cost", "budget.budget_project_staff", "budget.budget_consumables", "budget.budget_contingency", "budget.budget_travel", "budget.budget_others", "budget.budget_institutional_overheads"], "secondaryPointer