ved in any manner? | Reviewer goal: after the proposed technological solution is proven, how it will be scaled up or taken forward- whether by involving State Government for large scale technology dissemination or via market or any other means – any entrepreneur or business person can be involved in any manner? | Required facts: after the proposed technological solution is proven, how it will be scaled up or taken forward- whether by involving State Government for large scale technology dissemination or via market or any other means – any entrepreneur or business person can be involved in any manner?", "priority": "P2", "conversationRole": "context_only", "sourceTemplatePointer": "questions.possibility_of_replication"}, {"key": "submissionRules_international_travel_rule", "label": "International Travel", "origin": "template", "helpText": "International travel is not permissible under the projects. | Reviewer goal: International travel is not permissible under the projects. | Required facts: Directly answer \\"International Travel\\".", "priority": "P2", "conversationRole": "can_infer_and_confirm", "sourceTemplatePointer": "submissionRules.international_travel_rule"}, {"key": "budget_budget_overview", "label": "Budget overview", "origin": "template", "helpText": "Please give estimates, if the equipment is to be fabricated locally for prototype testing etc. Include installation charges, transport, taxes/duties/levies, etc. and try to avail tax/duty exemptions as applicable to your institution/ organization. Proper record should be maintained for the items procured under this Head. As per rule 149 of GFR, the procurement of Goods & Services is Mandatory for Goods and/or Services available on GeM Portal only and PI will also follow DoE's guidelines for incurring expenditure under the different sub-head. The budget under construction cost is only for low-cost structures like Common Facility Centre (CFC) and/or renovation or refurbishing of existing space and not for construction of new buildings or structures. Approval of such grant is at sole discretion of DST and as per extant GFR norms. Budgetary quotations (min. 3 no.) will be required in support of estimates for equipment, if project is approved for financial support.", "priority": "P1", "conversationRole": "can_infer_and_confirm", "sourceTemplatePointer": "budget.budget_overview"}, {"key": "budget_budget_equipment_cost", "label": "Equipment cost", "origin": "template", "helpText": "Mapped from the approved template", "priority": "P1", "conversationRole": "can_infer_and_confirm", "sourceTemplatePointer": "budget.budget_equipment_cost"}, {"key": "budget_budget_fabrication_installation_cost", "label": "Fabrication/ installation cost", "origin": "template", "helpText": "Bill of materials/estimate for fabrication & development cost should be provided", "priority": "P1", "conversationRole": "can_infer_and_confirm", "sourceTemplatePointer": "budget.budget_fabrication_installation_cost"}, {"key": "budget_budget_construction_cost", "label": "Construction cost", "origin": "template", "helpText": "Bill of materials/ estimate for construction cost should be provided. The budget under construction cost is only for low-cost structures like Common Facility Centre (CFC) and/or renovation or refurbishing of existing space and not for construction of new buildings or structures.", "priority": "P1", "conversationRole": "can_infer_and_confirm", "sourceTemplatePointer": "budget.budget_construction_cost"}, {"key": "budget_budget_project_staff", "label": "Project Staff", "origin": "template", "helpText": "team of scientists/engineers/technical support staff including social scientist, refer latest OM of SEED-DST", "priority": "P1", "conversationRole": "can_infer_and_confirm", "sourceTemplatePointer": "budget.budget_project_staff"}, {"key": "budget_budget_consumables", "label": "Consumables", "origin": "template", "helpText": "Supplies/Materials for adaptive R&D/technology refinement, Fabrication, I