olutions' template question."], "updatedAt": "2026-04-29T04:51:08.279Z", "confidence": 0.95, "factBullets": ["Existing solutions rely on centralized processing centers that are completely inaccessible to remote artisan groups.", "Consequently, unprocessed Sisal raw material is sold at distress prices."], "captureBasis": ["user_confirmed"], "thrustLinkage": ["Livelihoods"], "ruleCompliance": {"reason": null, "status": "ok", "rescopeNeeded": false}, "sourceTemplatePointer": "questions.existing_solutions_for_problem"}, "priority": "P2", "conversationRole": "can_infer_and_confirm", "sourceTemplatePointer": "questions.existing_solutions_for_problem"}, {"key": "questions_technology_gaps_and_solutions", "label": "Technology gaps and new innovative S&T component/ adaptive R&D solution proposed as per need identification", "status": "covered", "capture": {"keywords": ["technology gap", "off - grid", "micro - scale", "S&T validated"], "ruleNotes": ["Clearly demonstrates how the project progresses beyond the state-of-the-art by adapting tech for the target demographic."], "updatedAt": "2026-04-29T04:52:26.617Z", "confidence": 0.95, "factBullets": ["Technology Gap: Existing commercial decorticators are heavy, power-intensive, and inaccessible for decentralized rural use.", "Solution: Designing/adapting decentralized, off-grid (solar-assisted) micro-scale decorticators suitable for SC/ST women.", "Progress beyond state-of-the-art: Merges S&T mechanized extraction with the scientific standardization of traditional grading and eco-treatments."], "captureBasis": ["user_confirmed"], "thrustLinkage": ["science and technology", "capacity enhancement"], "ruleCompliance": {"reason": null, "status": "ok", "rescopeNeeded": false}, "sourceTemplatePointer": "questions.technology_gaps_and_solutions"}, "priority": "P2", "conversationRole": "can_infer_and_confirm", "sourceTemplatePointer": "questions.technology_gaps_and_solutions"}, {"key": "questions_proposed_objectives", "label": "Proposed O