cided on collectively by about sixty contributors. Data collection was organized from 2009 to 2010 using national groups consisting of four to ten members, depending on the countries, all of whom worked for public administrations dealing with forest issues. Data collected, covering for the most part 2008 and 2009, was validated during national workshops for public administration officials, environmental NGO representatives, the private sector and development projects. The data served to support the inputs provided by contributors of chapters for the current report, under the supervision of internationally recognized scientific committees. Furthermore, a State of the Forest 2010 sub-regional validation workshop was organized from 29 to 30 March 2011 for about 100 participants working in forest management, comprising representatives from the ten COMIFAC member countries, and several of its partners.", "publisher": "Centre de Coopération Internationale en Recherche Agronomique pour le Développement", "citationCount": 322, "fieldsOfStudy": ["National forest", "State forest", "State (computer science)", "Data collection", "Private sector"], "publicationDate": "2012-12-16", "publicationType": "book", "journalAbbreviation": "Agritrop (Cirad)"}, {"id": "oa_W1990764941", "doi": "10.5751/es-04714-170308", "url": "https://doi.org/10.5751/es-04714-170308", "issn": "1708-3087", "year": 2012, "issue": "3", "title": "Collaborative Engagement of Local and Traditional Knowledge and Science in Marine Environments: A Review", "venue": "Ecology and Society", "pdfUrl": "https://www.ecologyandsociety.org/vol17/iss3/art8/ES-2012-4714.pdf", "source": "openalex", "volume": "17", "authors": ["Thomas F. Thornton", "Adela Maciejewski . Scheer"], "rawData": {"id": "https://openalex.org/W1990764941", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5751/es-04714-170308", "ids": {"doi": "https://doi.org/10.5751/es-04714-170308", "mag": "1990764941", "openalex": "https://openalex.org/W1990764941"}, "fwci": 27.5193, "me