abstract": "We introduce LLaMA, a collection of foundation language models ranging from 7B to 65B parameters. We train our models on trillions of tokens, and show that it is possible to train state-of-the-art models using publicly available datasets exclusively, without resorting to proprietary and inaccessible datasets. In particular, LLaMA-13B outperforms GPT-3 (175B) on most benchmarks, and LLaMA-65B is competitive with the best models, Chinchilla-70B and PaLM-540B. We release all our models to the research community.", "publisher": "Cornell University", "citationCount": 3867, "fieldsOfStudy": ["Foundation (evidence)", "Computer science", "Ranging", "Language model", "State (computer science)"], "publicationDate": "2023-02-27", "publicationType": "preprint", "journalAbbreviation": "arXiv (Cornell University)"}, {"id": "oa_W4391855109", "doi": "10.1109/access.2024.3365742", "url": "https://doi.org/10.1109/access.2024.3365742", "issn": "2169-3536", "year": 2024, "pages": "26839-26874", "title": "A Review on Large Language Models: Architectures, Applications, Taxonomies, Open Issues and Challenges", "venue": "IEEE Access", "pdfUrl": "https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/ielx7/6287639/6514899/10433480.pdf", "source": "openalex", "volume": "12", "authors": ["Mohaimenul Azam Khan Raiaan", "Md. Saddam Hossain Mukta", "Kaniz Fatema", "Nur Mohammad Fahad", "Sadman Sakib", "Most. Marufatul Jannat Mim", "Jubaer Ahmad", "Mohammed Eunus Ali", "Sami Azam"], "rawData": {"id": "https://openalex.org/W4391855109", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.1109/access.2024.3365742", "ids": {"doi": "https://doi.org/10.1109/access.2024.3365742", "openalex": "https://openalex.org/W4391855109"}, "fwci": 210.4682, "mesh": [], "type": "review", "title": "A Review on Large Language Models: Architectures, Applications, Taxonomies, Open Issues and Challenges", "awards": [], "biblio": {"issue": null, "volume": "12", "last_page": "26874", "first_page": "26839"}, "topics": [{"id": "https://openalex.org/T10028", "fiel