r": "179", "prefix": "10.4135", "source": "Crossref", "created": {"date-time": "2018-01-05T04:05:32Z", "timestamp": 1515125132000, "date-parts": [[2018, 1, 5]]}, "indexed": {"date-time": "2024-09-10T03:17:38Z", "timestamp": 1725938258869, "date-parts": [[2024, 9, 10]]}, "resource": {"primary": {"URL": "http://sk.sagepub.com/cases/business-as-usual-district-education-authorities-in-punjab"}}, "deposited": {"date-time": "2018-01-05T04:05:33Z", "timestamp": 1515125133000, "date-parts": [[2018, 1, 5]]}, "isbn-type": [{"type": "electronic", "value": "9781526449276"}], "published": {"date-parts": [[2017]]}, "publisher": "SAGE Publications Pvt. Ltd", "alternative-id": ["10.4135/9781526449276"], "content-domain": {"domain": [], "crossmark-restriction": false}, "published-print": {"date-parts": [[2017]]}, "reference-count": 0, "references-count": 0, "publisher-location": "1 Oliver's Yard, 55 City Road, London EC1Y 1SP United Kingdom ", "is-referenced-by-count": 0}, "publisher": "SAGE Publications Pvt. Ltd", "citationCount": 0, "publicationDate": "2017", "publicationPlace": "1 Oliver's Yard, 55 City Road, London EC1Y 1SP United Kingdom"}, {"id": "cr_10.15415/jtmge.2017.81002", "doi": "10.15415/jtmge.2017.81002", "url": "https://doi.org/10.15415/jtmge.2017.81002", "issn": "0976-545X", "year": 2017, "issue": "1", "pages": "41-65", "title": "Determinants of Offshore Outsourcing Locations – A Comparison on Voice Based Jobs in India and Philippines", "venue": "Journal of Technology Management for Growing Economies", "pdfUrl": "https://tmg.chitkara.edu.in/index.php/tmge/article/download/28/16", "source": "crossref", "volume": "8", "authors": [",", "Mitra, Subhashish", "Mittal, Amit", ",", "Chand, Pawan Kumar", ","], "rawData": {"DOI": "10.15415/jtmge.2017.81002", "URL": "https://doi.org/10.15415/jtmge.2017.81002", "ISSN": ["0976-545X", "2456-3226"], "link": [{"URL": "https://tmg.chitkara.edu.in/index.php/tmge/article/download/28/16", "content-type": "application/pdf", "content-version": "vor", "intended-application": "text-mining"}, {"URL": "https://tmg.chitkara.edu.in/index.php/tmge/article/download/28/16", "content-type": "unspecified", "content-version": "vor", "intended-application": "similarity-checking"}], "page": "41-65", "type": "journal-article", "issue": "1", "score": 17.882877, "title": ["Determinants of Offshore Outsourcing Locations – A Comparison on Voice Based Jobs in India and Philippines"], "author": [{"name": "Chitkara Business School, Chitkara University, Punjab, India", "sequence": "first", "affiliation": []}, {"given": "Subhashish", "family": "Mitra", "sequence": "first", "affiliation": []}, {"given": "Amit", "family": "Mittal", "sequence": "additional", "affiliation": []}, {"name": "Chitkara Business School, Chitkara University, Punjab, India", "sequence": "additional", "affiliation": []}, {"given": "Pawan Kumar", "family": "Chand", "sequence": "additional", "affiliation": []}, {"name": "Chitkara Business School, Chitkara University, Punjab, India", "sequence": "additional", "affiliation": []}], "issued": {"date-parts": [[2017, 4]]}, "member": "6090", "prefix": "10.15415", "source": "Crossref", "volume": "8", "created": {"date-time": "2020-02-29T06:08:23Z", "timestamp": 1582956503000, "date-parts": [[2020, 2, 29]]}, "indexed": {"date-time": "2024-08-06T14:57:44Z", "timestamp": 1722956264227, "date-parts": [[2024, 8, 6]]}, "license": [{"URL": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/", "start": {"date-time": "2017-04-01T00:00:00Z", "timestamp": 1491004800000, "date-parts": [[2017, 4, 1]]}, "delay-in-days": 0, "content-version": "unspecified"}], "abstract": "<jats:p>Present study like to examine the variables that are significant, in the selection of offshore outsourcing locations for the voice based jobs in India and Philippines. The study has statistically tested human resources factors, finance factors, national level factors, communication, language, culture, client and service provider relationship, service delivery, organizations credentials and regulatory environment. The study has used descriptive research design, survey questionnaire method and deliberative purposive sampling techniques on the total sample size of 178 top and middle level employees of BPOs and Call centres. Data were analyzed using structure equation modeling, multiple regression, weighted least square method and Path analysis. Results of the study shows, overall affects of above discussed factor variables on the selection of location as Philippines are more than choosing India as preference of location for voice based jobs.</jats:p>", "resource": {"primary": {"URL": "https://tmg.chitkara.edu.in/2017/determinants-of-offshore-outsourcing-locations-a-comparison-on-voice-based-jobs-in-india-and-philippines/"}}, "deposited": {"date-time": "2024-06-04T08:37:57Z", "timestamp": 1717490277000, "date-parts": [[2024, 6, 4]]}, "issn-type": [{"type": "print", "value": "0976-545X"}, {"type": "electronic", "value": "2456-3226"}], "published": {"date-parts": [[2017, 4]]}, "publisher": "Chitkara University Publications", "journal-issue": {"issue": "1", "published-print": {"date-parts": [[2017, 4]]}, "published-online": {"date-parts": [[2017, 4]]}}, "content-domain": {"domain": [], "crossmark-restriction": false}, "original-title": ["Determinants of Offshore Outsourcing Locations – A Comparison on Voice Based Jobs in India and Philippines"], "container-title": ["Journal of Technology Management for Growing Economies"], "published-print": {"date-parts": [[2017, 4]]}, "reference-count": 0, "published-online": {"date-parts": [[2017, 4]]}, "references-count": 0, "short-container-title": ["JTMGE"], "is-referenced-by-count": 0}, "abstract": "<jats:p>Present study like to examine the variables that are significant, in the selection of offshore outsourcing locations for the voice based jobs in India and Philippines. The study has statistically tested human resources factors, finance factors, national level factors, communication, language, culture, client and service provider relationship, service delivery, organizations credentials and regulatory environment. The study has used descriptive research design, survey questionnaire method and deliberative purposive sampling techniques on the total sample size of 178 top and middle level employees of BPOs and Call centres. Data were analyzed using structure equation modeling, multiple regression, weighted least square method and Path analysis. Results of the study shows, overall affects of above discussed factor variables on the selection of location as Philippines are more than choosing India as preference of location for voice based jobs.</jats:p>", "publisher": "Chitkara University Publications", "citationCount": 0, "publicationDate": "2017-04", "journalAbbreviation": "JTMGE"}, {"id": "cr_10.54216/ajbor.050202", "doi": "10.54216/ajbor.050202", "url": "https://doi.org/10.54216/ajbor.050202", "year": 2021, "pages": "85-90", "title": "Analysis of Coronavirus Pandemic Spread in India Using Epidemiological Model", "venue": "American Journal of Business and Operations Research", "source": "crossref", "authors": [",", "S, Divya", "Sinha, Vijay Kumar", ",", "Aggarwal, Shruti", ","], "rawData": {"DOI": "10.54216/ajbor.050202", "URL": "https://doi.org/10.54216/ajbor.050202", "page": "85-90", "type": "journal-article", "score": 17.41044, "title": ["Analysis of Coronavirus Pandemic Spread in India Using Epidemiological Model"], "author": [{"name": "Department of CSE, Chandigarh University, Punjab, India", "sequence": "first", "affiliation": []}, {"given": "Divya", "family": "S", "sequence": "first", "affiliation": []}, {"given": "Vijay Kumar", "family": "Sinha", "sequence": "additional", "affiliation": []}, {"name": "Department of CSE, Chandigarh University, Punjab, India", "sequence": "additional", "affiliation": []}, {"given": "Shruti", "family": "Aggarwal", "sequence": "additional", "affiliation": []}, {"name": "Department of CSE, Chandigarh Universi