ss among the Baiga PVTG. With ~200 traditional healers remaining and a 10% annual knowledge attrition since the last systematic documentation in 1995, 70% of the community below the poverty line lacks access to scalable, culturally sensitive tools. The proposed S&T intervention deploys an AI-driven, voice-enabled mobile app to digitize oral IK, trains 50 youth Knowledge Brokers, and establishes 5 community STI Hubs. This directly aligns with NEP 2020’s emphasis on Indian Knowledge Systems and the Ministry of Tribal Affairs’ Digital Empowerment Scheme. No conflicting government projects exist for this proposal.	3144	DRAFT	f	1	2026-04-30 05:56:13.281	2026-04-30 05:56:13.281	2026-04-30 05:56:13.275	single_pass	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	{"grantDraftReadiness": {"issues": [], "warnings": []}, "grantComplianceReport": {"stage": "pass2", "passed": false, "generatedAt": "2026-04-30T05:56:13.226Z", "hardFailures": [{"key": "word_budget", "source": "system", "message": "Section exceeds the word budget of 100.", "ruleText": null}, {"key": "required_please specify", "source": "guideline", "message": "Required point is still missing: please specify", "ruleText": "please specify"}, {"key": "evidence_no preserved grant prep ", "source": "prep", "message": "Required drafting evidence is missing: No preserved Grant Prep evidence is reflected in the section draft.", "ruleText": "No preserved Grant Prep evidence is reflected in the section draft."}], "softWarnings": [{"key": "reviewer_signal_1", "source": "guideline", "message": "Required grant constraint is missing: Reviewer signal 1", "ruleText": "please specify"}, {"key": "reviewer_please specify", "source": "guideline", "message": "Reviewer-facing signal is weak or missing: please specify", "ruleText": "please specify"}, {"key": "narrative_please specify", "source": "template", "message": "Narrative guidance is not clearly reflected: please specify", "ruleText": "please specify"}], "missingEvidence": ["No preserved Grant Prep evi