citation to the exact burden statistic or urgency fact.\n\nEVIDENCE GAPS:\nModels for socio-economic development of women artisans through Self-Help Groups (SHGs), Alignment of artisan technology hubs with national schemes for traditional industries (e.g., SFURTI), Frameworks for artisan-led governance in community technology projects\n\nOUTPUT FORMAT:\n- Return ONLY clean Markdown. No JSON, no code fences, no preamble.\n- Preserve [CITE:key] anchors exactly when mapped evidence is used.\n- Default to a single compact block unless the template clearly requires bullets.	This proposal establishes a fundable STI Hub for the Phulkari craft, directly addressing the urgent need for technology adoption among 2,000 marginalized women artisans in Punjab to ensure generational preservation and socio-economic upliftment. Our intervention leverages context-appropriate, semi-mechanized tools and eco-friendly dyeing processes, delivered through existing Self-Help Groups (SHGs) to foster trust and rapid uptake. This approach aligns with the national MSME SFURTI initiative and will result in a measurable 50% increase in artisan production and doubled wages, thereby enhancing livelihoods and preserving a vital cultural heritage. The explicit inclusion of SHG leaders in the Hub Steering Committee ensures artisan governance, validating a scalable model for community-led technology adoption and socio-economic development within MSME clusters.	159	DRAFT	f	8	2026-04-28 06:10:00.728	2026-04-28 12:03:18.598	2026-04-28 12:03:18.594	single_pass	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	{"grantDraftReadiness": {"issues": [], "warnings": []}, "grantComplianceReport": {"stage": "pass2", "passed": false, "generatedAt": "2026-04-28T12:03:18.575Z", "hardFailures": [{"key": "template_required_fact_1", "source": "template", "message": "Required grant constraint is missing: Template required fact 1", "ruleText": "Directly answer \\"Proposed Subject Area\\"."}, {"key": "required_directly answer proposed", "source": 