evidence is used.\n- Default to a single compact block unless the template clearly requires bullets.	The Phulkari craft sector in Jalandhar's textile micro-clusters faces significant challenges, including low wages (under ₹5,000/month) and manual output restrictions that threaten generational preservation [CITE:Shrivastava2020]. While MSME schemes like SFURTI exist, they often overlook the specific needs of micro-clusters, leading to a technology gap and slow artisan adoption. This proposal’s STI Hub directly addresses this by aligning with existing frameworks and offering context-appropriate, semi-mechanized tools, ensuring sustainability and addressing unmet needs within this vital sector.	118	DRAFT	f	6	2026-04-28 06:10:00.582	2026-04-28 12:04:29.984	2026-04-28 12:04:29.978	single_pass	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	{"grantDraftReadiness": {"issues": [], "warnings": []}, "grantComplianceReport": {"stage": "pass2", "passed": false, "generatedAt": "2026-04-28T12:04:29.960Z", "hardFailures": [{"key": "template_required_fact_1", "source": "template", "message": "Required grant constraint is missing: Template required fact 1", "ruleText": "may refer to Industrial Profile of Districts by State Govt. and MSME schemes such as SFURTI/ ASPIRE/ Cluster/ innovation etc."}, {"key": "required_may refer to industrial ", "source": "guideline", "message": "Required point is still missing: may refer to Industrial Profile of Districts by State Govt. and MSME schemes such as SFURTI/ ASPIRE/ Cluster/ innovation etc.", "ruleText": "may refer to Industrial Profile of Districts by State Govt. and MSME schemes such as SFURTI/ ASPIRE/ Cluster/ innovation etc."}, {"key": "required_scale burden or urgency ", "source": "guideline", "message": "Required point is still missing: Scale, burden, or urgency of Brief Industrial Scenario of the target area: Aligns the proposed STI Hub with existing state and national economic frameworks to ensure sustainability", "ruleText": "Scale, burden, or urgency of